-- Real bug found and fixed 2026-09-08, same day/tick as the pagination-
-- index migration right before this one: that migration was
-- auto-generated by `prisma migrate dev`'s own schema diff, which
-- included an unintended `DROP INDEX "source_articles_title_trgm_idx"`
-- — this index was created via raw SQL in an earlier migration
-- (20260906194500_pg_trgm), so it has no representation in
-- schema.prisma's own `@@index` syntax (this Prisma version has no
-- clean, non-preview way to declare a GIN/trigram-opclass index
-- directly), and Prisma's diffing logic concluded it shouldn't exist.
-- Confirmed live (immediately after applying that migration) that the
-- drop genuinely happened on the real dev database, not just in the
-- generated SQL. This index backs the real word_similarity()/
-- similarity() queries apps/worker's own duplicate-detection and
-- story-clustering depend on (see docs/database.md "Embeddings").
--
-- Deliberately a SEPARATE, new migration rather than editing the
-- already-applied one directly: Prisma's own migration model depends
-- on an applied migration's file content matching its recorded
-- checksum — editing it after the fact (tried once, reverted) breaks
-- that guarantee for anyone else who ever applies this migration
-- history fresh. This migration restores the real end state (the index
-- exists) without altering migration history that already happened.
--
-- Any FUTURE `prisma migrate dev` run will regenerate the same
-- DROP INDEX diff for this exact reason (schema.prisma still has no
-- representation of it) — the real, durable fix would be adopting
-- Prisma's `extendedIndexes` preview feature to declare this GIN index
-- properly in schema.prisma; not done here since enabling a new
-- preview feature is a bigger, separate decision than this pagination-
-- index fix warranted. Flagged, not silently left as a landmine: any
-- future schema migration must re-check this index survived, the same
-- way this one didn't.
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS "source_articles_title_trgm_idx" ON "source_articles" USING gin ("title" gin_trgm_ops);
